    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">被惡魔力量腐化的普通豺狗變爲化豺，然後徘徊在大路小徑上，截殺所有遇到的目標。<br />化豺擁有三種可以隨意切換的身體形態。在它的真正形態和普通的豺狗一模一樣。它可以變成人類形態。該形態下，化豺通常是一個骨瘦如柴，用可憐的表情博取陌生人好感的傢伙。一旦旅行者將化豺接納到他們之中，這個怪物就會在發動攻擊時變成長着豺狗的皮毛和頭顱，卻用雙腳站立的半人形態。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>騙子與懦夫Beguilers and Cowards。</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">惡魔領主格拉茲特Graz'zt創造了化豺供其忠誠的僕人拉米亞lamias驅使。它從無底深淵出來，爲豺狗賦予語言能力與變成類人形態的技能。化豺爲謊言而生，而高感知的生物也許會注意到，化豺在說實話的時候反而會畏畏縮縮。<br />化豺喜歡與豺狗類的生物並肩作戰。在化豺領導下的豺狗是會成爲其殘忍而又忠誠的夥伴。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>邪惡僕從Supernatural Servants。</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">化豺爲它們的人身獅主人誘拐類人生物，等待着這些受害者的是終身的奴役或者痛苦的死亡。化豺的魔法凝視可以讓目標失去意識，方便化豺捆綁搬運。它們也會用其魔法凝視讓強大的敵人在一段時間內失去行動能力，以方便自己逃跑。</span></p><p>Ordinary jackals tainted by demonic power, jackalweres haunt roads and trails, waylaying and murdering those they meet.</p><p>A jackalwere has three physical forms that it shifts between. In its true form, it is indistinguishable from a normal jackal. It can take human form, often appearing gaunt and affecting a wretched demeanor to beg goodwill from strangers. When travelers welcome a jackalwere into their midst, the monster adopts its human-sized hybrid form, with the fur and head of a jackal but standing on two legs as it attacks.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Beguilers and Cowards\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Beguilers and Cowards.</span> The demon lord Graz'zt created jackalweres to serve his devoted servants, the lamias. Reaching out from the Abyss, he bestowed jackals with the gift of speech and the ability to assume humanoid forms. A jackalwere is born to lie, and perceptive creatures might notice it wincing in pain when it speaks the truth.</p><p>A jackalwere prefers to fight alongside jackals and others of its kind. Under the direction of jackalweres, jackals are fierce and loyal companions.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Supernatural Servants\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Supernatural Servants.</span> Jackalweres kidnap humanoids for their lamia masters, condemning victims to a lifetime of slavery or an agonizing death. A jackalwere's magical gaze renders a foe &amp;Reference[condition=unconscious], allowing the monster to bind a creature or drag it away.</p><p>A jackalwere might also use its gaze to incapacitate a deadly enemy long enough to make good its escape.</p></div></div></div>",
        "public": ""
      },
