    {
      "_id": "mhHx2auS8fnqDqI7",
      "name": "睡眠凝視Sleep Gaze",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "193",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">化豺凝視去周邊</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">30</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺內一個它能看見的生物。該目標必須進行一次</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">DC 10</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">的感知豁免。豁免失敗時，該目標將屈服於魔法睡眠中，陷入</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">分鐘的昏迷狀態，或直到某生物花費一個動作將其喚醒。豁免成功的生物將在隨後</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">24</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">小時裏免疫該化豺的凝視。不死生物以及免疫魅惑的生物不受該效應影響。</span></p><p>The jackalwere gazes at one creature it can see within 30 feet of it. The target must make a [[/save ability=wis dc=10]] saving throw. On a failed save, the target succumbs to a magical slumber, falling &amp;Reference[condition=unconscious] for 10 minutes or until someone uses an action to shake the target awake. A creature that successfully saves against the effect is immune to this jackalwere's gaze for the next 24 hours. Undead and creatures immune to being &amp;Reference[condition=charmed] aren't affected by it.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "requirements": "",
        "uses": {
          "max": "",
          "recovery": [],
          "spent": 0
        },
