    {
      "_id": "lTdiIvQZttZuFhKG",
      "name": "變形生物Shapechanger",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "193",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">化豺用一個動作變形爲一個特定的中型體型人類，或人豺混合的類人形態。它也同樣可以用該動作恢復其真實形態（一隻小型體型的豺狗</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">jackal</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）。除體型外，它的所有資料均不會發生改變。其隨身着裝和攜帶的裝備不會隨變形發生變化。在死亡時，化豺將恢復其真實形態。</span></p><p>The jackalwere can use its action to polymorph into a specific Medium human or a jackal-humanoid hybrid, or back into its true form (that of a Small jackal). Other than its size, its statistics are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn't transformed. It reverts to its true form if it dies.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "requirements": "",
